/quest_story_10123011","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10123011","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1012301101:0":{"text":"앞을 보세요. 또 그 나비들입니다.","source_cn":"看前方，又是那些蝴蝶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x653911E419326FA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/mn2/quest_story/10123020.json":{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10123020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10123020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1012302001:0":{"text":"이건 대체 뭐지? 너무 무섭게 생겼어!","source_cn":"这到底是什么东西？它长得太吓人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x285B76DEB9DD0D3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012302002:0":{"text":"이것들은 검은 나비와 함께 두 번이나 나타났어요. 아든 선생님이 나비를 따라가라고 했으니 무슨 연관이 있을지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"它们两次伴随着黑色蝴蝶出现，而雅顿老师让我们跟着蝴蝶，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x072282E22F244CB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012302003:0":{"text":"꼭 나비를 따라가야 해? 그럼 파란 나비를 따라가자... 적어도 그 나비들은 미샤르테의 메신저니까.","source_cn":"非得跟着蝴蝶吗？那起码跟着蓝色闪蝶吧……至少它们是弥萨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A0FCDBDB42E872F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012302004:0":{"text":"불평은 그만해. 어쩌면 달빛 그림자로 가는 유일한 방법일지도 몰라.","source_cn":"别抱怨了，这或许是前往月影乡的唯一方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BF91B54F880F280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/mn2/quest_story/10123030.json":{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10123030","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10123030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1012303001:1":{"text":"그 끔찍한 생물이 또 나타나려는 건가...","source_cn":"那种可怕的生物是不是又要出现了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA062B191C802976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1012303001":{"text":"그 끔찍한 생물이 또 나타나려는 건가...","source_cn":"那种可怕的生物是不是又要出现了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA062B191C802976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012303002:1":{"text":"이런... 괜히 지레 겁먹었네요.","source_cn":"什么……那我白做心理准备了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0320EE80AB41A23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012303003:1":{"text":"이게 우리의 마지막 시험이었으면 좋겠네요.","source_cn":"你向弥萨忒祈祷吧，但愿这是我们最后的考验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2DE15FA2B066353","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012303004:1":{"text":"이걸 시험이라고 생각해? 뭘 시험하는 걸까... 설마 용기?","source_cn":"你认为这是考验？考验什么啊……该不是考验胆量？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x550725C130213335","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012303005:1":{"text":"우리가 달빛 그림자로 들어갈 자격이 있는지에 대한 실험?","source_cn":"考验我们是否有进入月影乡的资格。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1A41371616E241B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012303006:1":{"text":"어디로 들어가지? 앞엔 길이 없는데.","source_cn":"从哪进？前面根本没路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C41005102CEE1A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012303007:1":{"text":"겉으로 보기엔 길이 없긴 해.","source_cn":"只是用肉眼看的话，前方确实没有路了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF96A5A5B03C1DCC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012303008:1":{"text":"로잔, 브라이언, 무슨 소리 들었어?","source_cn":"洛桑，布莱恩，你们能否听出什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC414112FD18F5E53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012303009:2":{"text":"지금은 안 들려요.","source_cn":"暂时不行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x149C5ABA52F2023D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012303010:1":{"text":"만약 이 모든 게 시험이라면, 처음엔 내 궁술을 시험한 거고, 두 번째는 에이론의 검술을 시험한 거야.","source_cn":"如果这一切真的是考验，第一次，是考验我的箭术，第二次，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA448076343DE2CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012303011:1":{"text":"이번엔 방랑자로서 너의 감지력을 시험하는 걸지도 몰라, 브라이언.","source_cn":"这一次，或许是考验你作为风语者的感知力，布莱恩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2577514C934ED0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012303012:2":{"text":"이곳의 방랑자는 저뿐만이 아닙니다. 로잔 님이 저보다 더 정찰에 능숙하시죠.","source_cn":"这里不止我一个风语者，洛桑比我更擅长探查。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFC672F33B27FDC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1012303013:1":{"text":"이럴 때 오히려 겸손해지네...","source_cn":"这时候你反倒谦虚起来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81A7FF2F570EF40E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_inde